{{> roleDefinition}}

Analyze the following SEO audit data for a website and generate a comprehensive, actionable SEO report.

{{> auditContext}}

## Category Breakdown:
{{#each categoryScores}}
- **{{this.category}}**: Score {{this.score}}/{{this.maxScore}} ({{this.checksCount}} checks, {{this.criticalCount}} critical, {{this.warningCount}} warnings)
{{/each}}

## Detailed Check Results:
{{#each checks}}
- {{severityEmoji this.severity}} **{{this.name}}** [{{this.category}}]: {{scoreBar this.score}}
  {{this.message}}
{{/each}}

## Page Metadata:
- Title: {{#if pageData.title}}"{{pageData.title}}"{{else}}MISSING{{/if}}
- Description: {{#if pageData.description}}"{{truncate pageData.description 120}}"{{else}}MISSING{{/if}}
- H1: {{#if pageData.h1}}"{{pageData.h1}}"{{else}}MISSING{{/if}}
- Load Time: {{pageData.loadTimeMs}}ms
- HTTPS: {{#if pageData.isHttps}}Yes{{else}}No{{/if}}
- Status Code: {{pageData.statusCode}}

---

Generate a structured SEO report with the following JSON format:

{
  "executiveSummary": "A 2-3 sentence overview of the site's SEO health",
  "overallAssessment": "One of: excellent | good | needs_improvement | poor | critical",
  "prioritizedActions": [
    {
      "priority": 1,
      "category": "onPage | technical | performance | content",
      "title": "Short action title",
      "description": "Detailed explanation of what to do",
      "impact": "high | medium | low",
      "effort": "quick_fix | moderate | major_project",
      "codeSnippet": "Optional HTML/code snippet to implement the fix"
    }
  ],
  "strengths": ["List of things the site does well"],
  "technicalRoadmap": [
    {
      "phase": "immediate | short_term | long_term",
      "action": "What to do",
      "expectedImpact": "Expected SEO improvement"
    }
  ],
  "contentRecommendations": [
    "Specific content improvement suggestions"
  ],
  "estimatedScoreAfterFixes": 85
}

Provide at least 5 prioritized actions, ordered by impact. Include code snippets where helpful (e.g., meta tag corrections, schema markup). Be specific, not generic.

{{> jsonOutputInstruction}}
